sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Cli
  participant S as Shrinker
  participant R as RunControl
  participant D as ShrinkDatabase
  participant E as HevcEncoder
  participant T as ResultTable
  actor O as Other terminal
  U->>C: mediatools shrink PATH
  C->>S: run(confirm)
  S->>R: start() (PID + log path)
  S->>S: plan(): DB, durations, codecs (cached)
  S->>U: plan, estimates - replace originals?
  U-->>S: y
  S->>R: begin_work()
  R->>R: fork, setsid, console file
  R-->>U: parent prints attach / stop hints and exits
  R->>R: child: sleep lock (systemd-inhibit)
  loop every planned video, largest first
    S->>R: stop requested?
    alt stop file present
      R-->>S: yes - end after this file
    end
    S->>E: encode(path, tmp) at nice 19
    E-->>S: ok? (exit code, stream, duration)
    alt ok
      S->>S: journalled copy into the original inode
      S->>D: record(path)
    else failed
      S->>S: original kept
    end
    S->>T: add(row) -> terminal, log, report file
    S->>R: status file (2 progress lines)
  end
  O->>R: mediatools stop (creates stop file)
  O->>R: mediatools attach (reads log + status)
  S->>T: finish()
  S->>R: finish() (remove PID, release lock)
